  "solution": {
    "text": "The volume of soap solution in a bubble <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>d</mi></math><br />now we make a drop<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><msup><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">R</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">d</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><msup><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">r</mtext><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#160;&#8658;&#160;</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">r</mtext><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">R</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">d</mtext></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br />Excess pressure initially <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">S</mtext></mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">R</mtext></mfrac></math><br /><br />Excess pressure finally <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">S</mtext></mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">r</mtext></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">S</mtext></mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">R</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">d</mtext></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mfrac></math><br /><br />Ratio&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">R</mtext><mrow><mn>24</mn><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">d</mtext></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msup></math>"
